license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Shabirahmad427/HiCel6A"
abstract: >
  Simulation input files and analysis scripts for the molecular dynamics study
  "Loop Dynamics, Substrate Binding, and Active Site Hydration in HiCel6A and its
  Catalytically Impaired D416A and D405N Mutants": three systems (HiCel6A,
  HiCel6A-D416A and HiCel6A-D405N, each with a cellooctaose substrate), three
  independent 2 microsecond replicas per system.
keywords:
  - molecular dynamics
  - AMBER
  - CHARMM-GUI
  - cellobiohydrolase
  - glycoside hydrolase family 6
  - HiCel6A
  - reproducibility
